  {
   "id": "R42-base-0007",
   "text": "Every vehicle bearing an approval mark under this Regulation shall conform to the vehicle type approved, particularly as regards features which influence the behaviour of the parts of the structure and the components affected by impact (e.g. the front protective device's dimensions, lines and materials).",
