   "text": "For the two longitudinal impacts on the front surface, the location of the first impact is free, but for the second impact the median plane of the impactor shall be at least 300 mm from the first, provided that the extremities of the impactor do not pass outside the zone defined by two planes parallel to the longitudinal median plane passing through the vehicle corners.",
